ps://www.cityvision.edu/about/ ? * -- No answer -- Yes No Mission Alignment Please read our mission statement and history at http://www.cityvision.edu/about. Please describe how your passion and life calling aligns with our mission and focus on educating Christians that serve the poor and addicted? Are there aspects of your background that give you a particular passion for serving this audience? What experience do you have serving this audience? This typically is the most important question we consider in screening applications, so please take the time to answer this thoroughly. * Testimony/Spiritual Journey As a Christian University, the vibrancy of the faith and spiritual life of our faculty is important. Briefly share your testimony and spiritual journey. What church do you attend and what is your current church involvement? * Instruction Experience Please describe your experience in teaching. Do you have any experience in online teaching? Have you ever designed any online courses? * What courses are you able to teach? What is your subject matter expertise? What courses are you about to teach from this list: http://www.cityvision.edu/course-schedule (be sure to list full course name, not just the course number). If you have taught courses before please list the courses you have taught and whether they were online. * What online courses have you taught or designed? Please list any courses that you have either taught online or have written (if any). Only list accredited online courses. For each course, indicate whether you taught, designed it or did both. * Human Check * Submit Application This website uses cookies and other analytics technologies. By selecting \"Allow\", you consent to the recording, use and sharing of your website activity by this website and its service providers. Allow Reject All Powered by"
